
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#F7F7F5" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="first-screen">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">trading<span>mind</span></a>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Coaching</a>
          <a href="/course">Free course</a>
          <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Develop your <em>nervous system capacity</em></h1>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders who want to develop the capacity to perform well under pressure.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Explore coaching</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <main>
      <section class="text-section" id="approach">
        <div class="text-content">
          <div class="text-heading">
            <h2>A different approach to the psychology of trading</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="text-body">
            <p class="text-lead">
              Trading places extraordinary demands on your ability to perform well
              under pressure.
            </p>

            <p>
              It doesn't matter how good your strategy is if you can't execute it.
              If you find yourself overtrading, caught in addictive patterns, burning
              out or becoming overwhelmed by decisions, capacity is the constraint.
            </p>

            <p>
              Rather than focusing on controlling emotions or correcting unwanted
              behaviour through willpower or discipline, I work with the underlying
              nervous system patterns impacting your ability to perform well under
              pressure.
            </p>

            <p>
              By drawing on your natural ability to adapt and self-organise, and by
              following what is interesting or enjoyable, we work together to
              increase your general wellbeing, develop greater flexibility under
              pressure and more freedom in your decisions, become more resilient,
              and ultimately build a more sustainable relationship with trading.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section" id="contact">
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/">trading<span>mind</span></a>
      <p class="copyright">© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #F7F7F5;
    --ink: #292A2D;
    --muted: #777B80;
    --olive: #858C82;
    --line: #DFE0DD;
    --soft: #ECEDEB;
  }

  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 100px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a), :global(a:visited) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--olive);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .first-screen {
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .site-header {
    min-height: 86px;
    padding: 0 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -1.25px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .brand > span {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 38px);
  }

  .nav-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: #55585B;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--olive);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #C9CBC8;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .hero {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 60px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 790px;
  }

  h1, h2, p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 6.2vw, 77px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -4.4px;
    line-height: 1.07;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--olive);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button {
    min-height: 47px;
    padding: 0 19px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
    transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-dark, .button-dark:visited {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff !important;
  }

  .button-dark:hover {
    background: #414246;
  }

  .text-section {
    padding: 100px 7.2% 110px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .text-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 10%;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .text-heading h2 {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .text-body {
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .text-body p {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .text-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-body .text-lead {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .contact-section {
    padding: 88px 7.2% 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 27px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .button-light, .button-light:visited {
    border: 1px solid #C9CBC8;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .button-light:hover {
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  .site-footer {
    min-height: 83px;
    padding: 22px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .site-header, .hero, .text-section,
    .contact-section, .site-footer {
      padding-left: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 6%;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 21px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 21px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .nav-links .nav-cta {
      padding: 7px 10px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 45px 6%;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 10vw, 65px);
      letter-spacing: -2.8px;
    }

    .text-section {
      padding: 68px 6% 76px;
    }

    .text-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .text-heading h2 {
      max-width: 500px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 42px);
      letter-spacing: -1.4px;
    }

    .text-body p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .text-body .text-lead {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .contact-section {
      padding: 70px 6%;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 24px 6%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-height: 750px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 35px;
      padding-bottom: 35px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 65px);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }

    :global(*), :global(*::before), :global(*::after) {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
